creature Train
  traits
    name is text
    station is text
  end traits

  when born with (name)
    give self the trait name to name
    give self the trait station to "Station A"
    say self name + " starts at " + self station
  end born

  action travel
    when self station == "Station A"
      give self the trait station to "Station B"
      say self name + " travels to Station B."
    otherwise
      when self station == "Station B"
        give self the trait station to "Station C"
        say self name + " travels to Station C."
      otherwise
        when self station == "Station C"
          give self the trait station to "Station A"
          say self name + " travels back to Station A."
        end when
      end when
    end when
  end action
end creature

bring Express to life as Train with ("Express Train 1")

Express does travel
Express does travel
Express does travel
Express does travel
